{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "060T", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "REF_0001": "\\ref{descent-lemma-finite-locally-free-descends}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:52edb46e123b5738f1229601392f32a16963c65129ed7ccdb9724ebeb42bb18e", "source_text": "This follows from the case of schemes, see\nDescent, Lemma <REF_0001>,\nby <ACCENT_0001>tale localization.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e26f3991ec664a65ddc4d00d9ca3d1becbd29a953b72e99526485a3a67e3fc83", "unit_id": "tag:060X:proof"}
{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "060T", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-properties-section-locally-projective}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:89f618e7f6d7c43436db5e28bdf92d4d78db2b25c8799e1d7c4e100e08d782b0", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe definition of a locally projective quasi-coherent sheaf can be found in\nProperties of Spaces, Section\n<REF_0001>.\nIt is also proved there that this notion is preserved under pullback.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8c1396771a1b7a2d0755fc853de81a65ac39d3cd567a81cf5aaa24a8503b6468", "unit_id": "tag:060T:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "060T", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0005": "$\\{f_i : X_i \\to X\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0006": "$f_i^*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X_i}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-locally-projective-descends}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:266aeb44fb7cf41e7d9d16ef48692b6c4d7411739f724b0886a94c29d5d4b6a5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1f566b91953494b5d911492ec3b16d8b3a4d0792e35c5d1118146f18f497648b", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic space over a scheme <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a quasi-coherent <MATH_0004>-module.\nLet <MATH_0005> be an fpqc covering such that\neach <MATH_0006> is a locally projective <MATH_0007>-module.\nThen <MATH_0008> is a locally projective <MATH_0009>-module.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:36cafa2c3c7341090f200091d4e0d0cfd45e8b2b1d3d4ca3608b1eea1eaa7853", "unit_id": "tag:060Y:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "060T", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "REF_0001": "\\ref{descent-lemma-locally-projective-descends}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:aa73a42fc823095690bcb6bbc2d0f768f67a6e501e4da2e22002848399f9c1f6", "source_text": "This follows from the case of schemes, see\nDescent, Lemma <REF_0001>,\nby <ACCENT_0001>tale localization.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e26f3991ec664a65ddc4d00d9ca3d1becbd29a953b72e99526485a3a67e3fc83", "unit_id": "tag:060Y:proof"}
{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "060T", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e16ae82364cc39d56fb50403c15ea4f3726bf189e0931d38caf496e181b6ee7e", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe also add here two results which are related to the results above, but\nare of a slightly different nature.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:aca14121c405882db0c87a5206bade899bf29e967a36f334f9f0e685931321b3", "unit_id": "tag:060T:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "060T", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0006": "$f$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0009": "$f_*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{O}_Y$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-over-finite-module}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:edc02ce56694407c8403a8e4832cf219c77e3c4adf5b683e818a7a9eea29def6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e5cc29f4f83394cd5cdac3a1928825cf9f16a674f5a567ec6baa6071e5750dc0", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a morphism of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a quasi-coherent <MATH_0005>-module.\nAssume <MATH_0006> is a finite morphism.\nThen <MATH_0007> is an <MATH_0008>-module of finite type\nif and only if <MATH_0009> is an <MATH_0010>-module of finite\ntype.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:88af16837750c842281954c1ac2938eac8dcfcc69a1750a9f30b2131cfab7da8", "unit_id": "tag:060Z:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "060T", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$f$", "MATH_0002": "$V$", "MATH_0003": "$V \\to Y$", "MATH_0004": "$U = V \\times_Y X$", "MATH_0005": "$X$", "MATH_0006": "$\\psi : U \\to V$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "MATH_0008": "$\\psi_*(\\mathcal{F}|_U) = f_*\\mathcal{F}|_V$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{descent-lemma-finite-over-finite-module}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:108ca53f30c8aaa9322482f73224d5f510d350695e7ca59118fede5df221bd7f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2e9d56f3970c5555afc40d757b4d0882df98762f3d7f979f73f75dc1a8c9079c", "source_text": "As <MATH_0001> is finite it is representable. Choose a scheme <MATH_0002> and a surjective\n<ACCENT_0001>tale morphism <MATH_0003>. Then <MATH_0004> is a scheme with\na surjective <ACCENT_0002>tale morphism towards <MATH_0005> and a finite morphism\n<MATH_0006> (the base change of <MATH_0007>). Since\n<MATH_0008>\nthe result of the lemma follows immediately from the schemes version which\nis\nDescent, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7db44d450684ffb534f7a2a6ad4b294d5b0d9d2a06fa64feb368880c391557eb", "unit_id": "tag:060Z:proof"}
